 and service centers, as well as direct-to-consumer sales through online platforms. This segment also sells replacement glass and awnings to fulfill insurance claims; and biminis, covers, buoys, fenders, towing products, truck accessories, appliances, air conditioners, televisions, sound systems, and tankless water heaters. LCI Industries was formerly known as Drew Industries Incorporated and changed its name to LCI Industries in December 2016. The company was founded in 1956 and is headquartered in Elkhart, Indiana.","employees":12300,"website":"https://corporate.lippert.com","country":"United States","city":"Elkhart","officers":[{"name":"Mr. John A. Sirpilla","title":"Interim CEO & Director"},{"name":"Ms. Lillian D. Etzkorn","title":"Executive VP & CFO"},{"name":"Mr. Jason Douglas Lippert","title":"Advisor"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":14.66,"tpe":19.58,"ps":1.262,"pfcf":19.41,"peg":1.17,"pb":2.88,"ev_ebitda":12.01,"rev_growth":0.055,"eps_growth":0.1605,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1115,"eps_growth_next":0.1248,"div_yield":0.00765,"roe":0.1518,"roa":0.06139,"de":104.4,"gross_margin":0.3788,"op_margin":0.09681,"profit_margin":0.05749,"current_ratio":1.456},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":10.78,"sector":14.66,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":12.04,"sector":19.58,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":0.6024,"sector":1.262,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":10.09,"sector":19.41,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":1.04,"sector":1.17,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":1.646,"sector":2.88,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":78.16,"sector":104.4,"verdict":"Low debt"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue growth","v":-0.042,"sector":0.055,"verdict":"Weak"},{"k":"eps_growth","label":"EPS growth (last qtr, y/y)","v":-0.196,"sector":0.1605,"verdict":"Weak"},{"k":"eps_growth_fwd","label":"EPS growth (this year, est.)","v